  eyebrow: 'PRIVATE ROADS, HANDLED PROPERLY',
  headline: 'The Logistics Are Part of the Service',
  paragraphs: [
    "Getting a service truck to a Hope Ranch kitchen involves things a normal service call doesn't: the gate, the access list, the patrol that keeps an eye on unfamiliar vehicles, the long shared driveways, the household's preferences about when and where service traffic is welcome. We treat all of it as part of the job, not friction around it.",
