    "And when the caller is a property manager running the parcel for an owner who's elsewhere, everything forwards cleanly: written estimates for remote approval, photos of what we found, invoices to the office, and one number — the same <a href=\"/santa-barbara/\">Santa Barbara branch</a> — covering this property and any others on the South Coast."
